{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 119,
    "dDurationMs": 4601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This wouldn't be a youtube channel without\na cat video - so without further ado, we present:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4720,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Schrodinger's cat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5720,
    "dDurationMs": 3590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm sure you've heard some version of this\nfamous thought experiment: you put a cat in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9310,
    "dDurationMs": 3619,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a bunker with some unstable gunpowder that\nhas a 50% chance of blowing up in the next"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12929,
    "dDurationMs": 2221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "minute, and 50% chance of doing nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15150,
    "dDurationMs": 5650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[the gunpowder is Einstein's version - Schrodinger\npreferred poisonous gas] So until we look"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20800,
    "dDurationMs": 4431,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the bunker, we don't know whether the cat\nis dead or alive, and when we do look, it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25231,
    "dDurationMs": 1719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is either dead or alive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26950,
    "dDurationMs": 4570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if we repeat the experiment enough times\nwith enough cats and bunkers and gunpowder,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31520,
    "dDurationMs": 3859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we'll see that half the time kitty survives,\nand half the time kitty goes bye-bye."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35379,
    "dDurationMs": 4781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The quantum mechanical interpretation is that\nbefore we look, the cat is in a superposition"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40160,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- it's both dead AND alive - and our act of\nlooking forces nature's decision."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44940,
    "dDurationMs": 2049,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So our curiosity kills the cat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46989,
    "dDurationMs": 1721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what about the cat's perspective?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48710,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the cat either sees the gunpowder explode,\nor not – so inside the bunker we actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53510,
    "dDurationMs": 4029,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have these two possibilities: \"the powder\nexploded and the cat saw it explode\" or \"the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57539,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "powder didn't explode and the cat didn't see\nit explode\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60499,
    "dDurationMs": 4241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's no option: \"the powder exploded and\nthe cat didn't see it explode\" - so the cat's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64740,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reality becomes entangled with the outcome\nof the experiment!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67740,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's our observation of the experiment\nthat forces nature to \"collapse\" to one option"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71820,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73430,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we're like the cat, too – either the\ncat dies and we see it dead, or the cat lives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78270,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we see it alive – so who's observing\nus to force nature to \"collapse\" to one reality?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83290,
    "dDurationMs": 4250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or do both possibilities happen in parallel\nwithin a larger multiverse?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87540,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This \"collapsing to one reality\" problem is\none of the biggest unanswered questions in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91720,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "quantum physics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92880,
    "dDurationMs": 12910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for kitty's sake, can i has answer pleez?"
    } ]
  } ]
}
